<title>GERMANY: German engineering orders fell 11 pct in September.</title>
<headline>German engineering orders fell 11 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering orders fell by 11 percent in real terms in September from the same 1995 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said.</p>
<p>In the three months from July though September orders were seven percent below the same 1995 period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    September    change in pct July-Sept	   change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    -11	  overall		-7</p>
<p>    of which German  -11	  of which German    -9</p>
<p>		 foreign -11	  foreign		-5</p>
<p>-Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
